---
title: One Pot Tomato Orzo Recipe
description: This easy One-Pot Basil and Tomato Orzo Recipe is perfect for busy weeknight meals. It's flavorful, satisfying, and it's ready in 30 minutes or less!
image: https://veganhuggs.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/04/one-pot-tomato-orzo-recipe-2.jpg
cook time: 20 minutes
servings: 4 people
tags: orzo, pasta, vegan, dinner, one-pot, italian, quick
time required: 30 minutes
